  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.6 - OnBeforeIncludeRender Event (January 2026)\n- NEW: OnBeforeIncludeRender callback - fires before each Include renders\n- Enables dynamic data loading per component (cache fetch, DB query)\n- Param default attribute + Folder-based components\n- Error messages in HTML comments for debugging\n\nv1.0.5 - Pre-Render Data Extraction\n- ExtractIncludeNames() - Get cache keys before rendering\n- PrepareTemplate() + RenderPrepared() for maximum efficiency\n\nv1.0.4 - Auto Cache Invalidation\n- Component files auto-reload on modification\n\nv1.0.3 - Dynamic Param Values\nv1.0.2 - Documentation Update\nv1.0.0 - Initial Release",
